# GitHub & MCP — SDLC

## MCP (Cursor)

- Config: `.cursor/mcp.json` — server `github` (remote ou Docker)
- Token: env `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN`
- Skill: `.sdlc/skills/github-sdlc/SKILL.md`

## Lifecycle

Intent (issue) → branch → spec → PR → Actions → merge

Workflow: `.sdlc/workflows/github-lifecycle.md`

## Scripts

```powershell
.sdlc/scripts/gh-issue-intent.ps1 -Title "[Intent] …"
.sdlc/scripts/gh-pr-open.ps1 -Title "feat: …" -Issue 12
.sdlc/scripts/gh-sdlc-status.ps1
.sdlc/scripts/gh-labels-bootstrap.ps1
```

## Labels SDLC

`sdlc:intent`, `sdlc:spec`, `sdlc:implement`, `sdlc:ready`, `sdlc:blocked`

## Segurança

- PAT nunca no repo
- Não force-push `main`
